{
  "work_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister",
  "source_path": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister.json",
  "source_language": "sga",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-11-12",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.1.s1",
      "source_sha256": "b63907cc4f4c41b9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The sister of Mo Laisse of Leighlin was studying under Mo Laisse. It was she, then, who used to wait on the cleric."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.1.s2",
      "source_sha256": "f8c0c2392f1678ce",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "There was a young cleric in the cleric's company. He and the young nun came together, so that she became pregnant by him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.2.s1",
      "source_sha256": "86b0fed4b589a1fb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'Evil will come of this,' said the woman, 'if the cleric finds out. He will turn his hatred on us, so that we will get neither heaven nor earth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.2.s2",
      "source_sha256": "63346c98ffd581a0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'It is enough, then,' she said, 'that I should be destroyed. Go and keep out of his way!'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.3",
      "source_sha256": "12d29b467def8110",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'You will not name me, then, woman!' said the young cleric."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.4.s1",
      "source_sha256": "4ecdd60e6dd59fd7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'I will not tell, as long as you take my part,' said the woman."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.4.s2",
      "source_sha256": "1d2a418950131620",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'Undertake my requiem well!' she said."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.5",
      "source_sha256": "228aaed83156df30",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'If I am alive,' he said, 'you will not be in hell.'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.6",
      "source_sha256": "da031adb42eeaf51",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'That rests with God's protection,' she said."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.7",
      "source_sha256": "3e3ac98c44ba76a9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "After that he went away and stayed in Armagh."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.8",
      "source_sha256": "f52f3d8c8ebe1f64",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then someone said to Mo Laisse: 'Cleric, the young nun is in labour.'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.9",
      "source_sha256": "c20cee780fc3adbe",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'May they be the pangs of a swift death,' said Mo Laisse, and he denied her heaven and earth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.10.s1",
      "source_sha256": "5da5b6e182559429",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That came true. Communion did not reach her. She went between earth and hell."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.10.s2",
      "source_sha256": "133e4ae00ed57a12",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The cleric did not allow her to be buried in the churchyard, so she was buried in the bog below the church."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.11",
      "source_sha256": "9ec696747731e7c1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A young cleric from Leinster came to him at Armagh."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.12",
      "source_sha256": "a1a9de067a87704e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'How is Mo Laisse?' he asked."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.13",
      "source_sha256": "da344b8640c05148",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'Just the same,' said the young cleric."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.14",
      "source_sha256": "5caf5b3c14f0b2c2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'And the young nun?'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.15",
      "source_sha256": "1e7e4b335385169e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'This is how it is,' he said. 'She went between earth and hell. It is not known who did it to her.'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.16",
      "source_sha256": "4e9c5a236b11549a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'Good, then,' he said."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.17.s1",
      "source_sha256": "1e1097cb4ea6f1f4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "After that he did not neglect to undertake her requiem, that is:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.17.s2",
      "source_sha256": "697a6847fdd94f3a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "seven Beati every day, a hundred prostrations, and the three fifties [the Psalter] every day."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.18",
      "source_sha256": "baec660b7c77e651",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "After that he comes back from the north. He greets the cleric."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.19",
      "source_sha256": "b5f53d76072d06e4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He asks him about everything."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.20",
      "source_sha256": "dca6d23dccf5f4d9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "'This is how it is,' said the cleric."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.21",
      "source_sha256": "9c57da266796783d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "\"I would like,\" said the young cleric, \"a secret little hut outside the church, for praying [?] to God.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.22",
      "source_sha256": "34cbb22ed5e142c5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "\"Good,\" said the cleric."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.23",
      "source_sha256": "ac1da59b21cdc547",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "He made a hut like that near the grave. He spent a year there. Then one time he saw her coming to him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.24",
      "source_sha256": "e1b021bec2fe2e82",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "\"A blessing on your soul,\" she said. \"You have been good to me. You have very nearly set me free.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.25",
      "source_sha256": "d82e92477f834c08",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "\"What has done most to set you free?\" said the young cleric."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.26.s1",
      "source_sha256": "27917c41b79fac37",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "\"The Beati,\" she said. Then she said: \"O long song full of vigils [?], the Beati, beloved is that worship."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.26.s2",
      "source_sha256": "9d773eea7e4cc95e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "If it had been sung diligently over me, I would not have been in damnation for any length of time."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.26.s3",
      "source_sha256": "d866b33356063209",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "The Beati, beloved worship: happy is the soul for which it is sung! The King who grants it to us considers it worth twenty-four heifers.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.27",
      "source_sha256": "62f6cf3b12e276a2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "\"That is the Beati,\" she said. \"It is what has helped me.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.28",
      "source_sha256": "80685ba768ccc41c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "Then one time the devout Fursa came to the church, and he saw angels ministering at the grave in the bog."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.29",
      "source_sha256": "484c74b0e549f3e6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "\"Well, Molaisse,\" said Fursa, \"what saint is in the bog?\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.30",
      "source_sha256": "ffefee28dc7fd68a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "\"It is an idol,\" said Molaisse, \"a demon of a nun.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.31",
      "source_sha256": "336b827461f484ce",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "\"Look at this, Molaisse,\" said Fursa. And he saw it: angels ministering from the grave up to heaven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.32.s1",
      "source_sha256": "aeab3191d7bc47f1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "The body was then taken out of the bog and buried in the cemetery."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.32.s2",
      "source_sha256": "ec49630a9aaff82c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "And Fursa took the young cleric under his protection (or: heard the young cleric's confession) [?], so that he made a saint of the young cleric, and he went to heaven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "celt/molaisse-and-his-sister#Molaisse.33",
      "source_sha256": "8e8e951a65b853b2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-12",
      "group_size": 16,
      "text": "So the Beati is better than any other prayer for rescuing a soul from demons."
    }
  ]
}
